	// So the meeting time should be strictly between simionDeparture and simionArrival
	// Two vehicles meet if there exists a time T such that:
	//   simionDeparture < T < simionArrival
	//   t < T < t + tb
	// This is equivalent to:
	//   simionDeparture < t + tb  AND  t < simionArrival
	// i.e., t < simionArrival AND t > simionDeparture - tb

